{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ecab702618df2875bbd92fd7604fac274a1969e46572cb27c99ad25aed84dd82","ja":"チョコのお宝","zh":"巧克力宝藏","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3f787f7e85785027896a4e189eea748bf901f63a66cbadf7092dfcea3751d789","ja":"杏奈は丹精込めてチョコを作り、\n大精霊がいるという森にやってきた……","zh":"杏奈精心制作了巧克力，\n来到了据说住着大精灵的森林……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7336ff10805a7e4c06d1e4e56835e98570909b014e3f075f60d677c6c00649af","ja":"（大精霊様って、どんな人なんだろ！？\nちょっとドキドキするかもっ！）","zh":"（大精灵大人是个什么样的人呢！？\n可能会有点怦怦直跳呢！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0b047d33fbb9c1f593893ea70390f2916daa434c2fb24804d1c101dade645e9a","ja":"くんくんくん……なんだかとてつもない\nオーラを感じるよ～～～！","zh":"嗅嗅嗅……总觉得有种不得了\n的气场呢～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1866bae7d44bf1bf788c007077426b914d1cd51ff46a984e3ead20cbf114cc91","ja":"あっ、チョコレート！　すっごくおいしそう！\n食べていいの～？","zh":"啊，巧克力！看起来好好吃！\n可以吃吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"249b0a0825a6fe2f8cfac05dc18eff80a7baef09459edaf518fd414ad2ba2a9b","ja":"わあっ！？　……なんだ、大精霊様って\n茜さんと恵美さんだったんだね！","zh":"哇啊！？……什么嘛，所谓的大精灵大人\n原来是茜和惠美啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2b08e4c7814a4d69eca846478fc24a2b84f76a668e018fcc7712f9e5334e51ae","ja":"なんだって！？　いきなり失礼だねっ！\n大精霊チョコねちゃんはレアキャラだよ！？","zh":"你说什么？！太失礼了吧！\n大精灵小茜可是稀有角色哦？！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a23bd48719fd04db2076f5fa3a7406e82e0589ba5fa7932730f6e52df7e2e177","ja":"アタシだってすんごい精霊なんだからねっ！","zh":"我也很厉害的精灵哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d252da8c02e353c2c2a97e38cc331a38fa5dfde96d15f250ff01ca2dca18b2a8","ja":"そっか～☆　じゃあ雨を降らせることも\n余裕だよねっ？　ねっ？","zh":"这样啊～☆　那让天下雨这件事\n也很轻松吧？　对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b5fe44b42c0ec0234dca36630886903b95cc10109cf3840590a0d7ba9d7ce833","ja":"まあね？　あ、でもこのチョコが\nおいしくなかったらダメだよ……もぐもぐもぐ。","zh":"算是吧？啊，不过这块巧克力\n要是不好吃可不行……嚼嚼嚼。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7c37bbffa7728129a80ddbd67926ad3842e8c0e786592651520ed8b006ef9801","ja":"もぐもぐもぐ……。","zh":"嚼嚼嚼……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"eae40592fadb61a2c03aa668fffef095b8c980939e06476b874ee23bf595989c","ja":"わぁ～……これ、め～っちゃおいしいじゃん！\n仕方ないな～。久しぶりに本気出しちゃうか～！","zh":"哇～……这个，超好吃的啊！\n真没办法～。好久没认真了，这次就拿出真本事吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0995d9a730e64b66e31127d0e1c964f670f699c4e9dc702202ecca8573759289","ja":"うんうん♪　こんなにおいしいのもらったら、\n張り切らないとだよね♪　それじゃあ……。","zh":"嗯嗯♪　收到这么好吃的东西，\n得好好努力才行呢♪　那么……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"95a6ce00868b65695f87196c79ea5e2c82b814e357a74ce6dcae3dbdbcd78a2d","ja":"チョコねちゃんパワー……全っ開っ！\nおおおおおおおっ！","zh":"巧克力茜的力量……全～开～！\n喔喔喔喔喔喔喔！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f6257e73742dcbcdc093a78220265a557eed8722a0d9ddfe541d31acc4d6df53","ja":"はああああ～っ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"759bb6541b5c6e1f35212e3b23422ee6ed683e9eb76c34e3757a40c31dfaa6c8","ja":"わあああああ～～～～！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7a1715f96b6760bd3eeb30d18ddaec2468dd950ec4b548ca2cf47dcd70e477d9","ja":"わ～い、わ～い！　雨がすっごく降ってますよ～！\n無事に大精霊様に、チョコを渡せたんですねっ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"2a684d54df10e8cc96c01e9a09fe9ae5a81ae5ab4faae218c9344f8de27d72b6","ja":"本当にありがとうございました！\nあなたが来てくれてよかった！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"ecbb22145474bbb75aeab6b866e08b4ee9d1f9dc6ece4d9d09e07f82382f5a1e","ja":"お礼にこの国の秘宝をなんでもお渡しいたします。\nチョコダイヤモンドや、チョコ馬車など……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"9be4004730698196dd19e0224dedd1515bd35ce2cb7a3558d867a5271b01bf66","ja":"わあっ！　こんなに！？　えへへ、やった～～～！\nチョコダイヤモンド、すっごくキラキラしてるっ♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8499aaac3d646ff0570f1c9217a83f6f081c8719534eb2cd43dff055e593e4bd","ja":"あれ……？　でも、どうして……？\n掴め……な……い……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"41be1911f41e41a887d39df427b28e56971dac47a7b606e33eff6036e7b9f511","ja":"（ん……？　控室……？　杏奈……夢、見てた……？\nチョコのお宝、欲しかったな……）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"acb6ab4b8bfb948b5915e5023bd5b8dcf6a6f5981912161bb1c8f4fc57237f9a","ja":"（ずっと……寝ちゃってた……でも、寒く、ない……？\nあ……毛布……誰かが、かけてくれてたんだ……♪）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1004.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"8d61eade6f2dd218d56fcb658b2b9ab6bbdcc92f2d8930340d8d6e402bbdaa7f","ja":"それに……チョコも、置いて、ある……？　えっと……\n「レッスンお疲れ！　未来・恵美・紗代子・茜」……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
